{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Ironbook 是一款將訓練日誌設計成健身房黑板風格的應用程式，以粉筆、鐵與紅膠帶呈現，適合重視重量訓練進度、需要即時查看上次表現的健身人士。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>訓練記錄一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>Ironbook 以黑板風格記錄訓練，內置三個範本。每個訓練組會顯示上次重量與次數，勾選後自動複製並啟動休息計時，可選 1:00、1:30、2:00 或 3:00，時間到會提示。程式支援槓片計算與即時新增動作，完成後提示是否刷新 PR。歷史可一鍵重複舊訓練；進度顯示估算 1RM、PR 標記與每週訓練量。支援 kg 或 lb，無帳戶、無廣告、無追蹤，資料不離開手機。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-381-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-382-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-383-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-384-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-385-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-386-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Ironbook: Workout Log</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T23:38:40.025698+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}